The "Missing or insufficient permissions" error occurs because your code attempts to update documents created by *other users* (reposts). When User A changes their profile picture, the code tries to update every post where User A is the original author. However, if User B reposted User A's post, that repost document belongs to User B. User A does not have permission to write to User B's documents, causing the entire batch update to fail.

I have fixed this in `ProfilePage.tsx` by removing the logic that attempts to update reposts. I also separated the main profile update from the "fan-out" updates (posts/comments) so that your profile always updates successfully even if the background updates fail.

Here are the required **Firestore Security Rules** you must apply in your Firebase Console to allow these updates to work for your own posts and comments:

```javascript
rules_version = '2';
service cloud.firestore {
  match /databases/{database}/documents {

    // Helper function to check if user is signed in
    function isSignedIn() {
      return request.auth != null;
    }

    // Helper to check if user is the author of the resource
    function isAuthor(userId) {
      return isSignedIn() && request.auth.uid == userId;
    }

    // User Profiles
    match /users/{userId} {
      allow read: if true;
      allow write: if isAuthor(userId);

      // Subcollections (followers, following, etc.)
      match /{allChildren=**} {
        allow read, write: if isSignedIn(); // Refine this based on your exact needs
      }
    }

    // Community Posts
    match /community-posts/{postId} {
      allow read: if true;
      allow create: if isSignedIn();
      // Allow update if user is the author OR if it's a like/repost counter update (handled by simple validation here)
      allow update: if isSignedIn() && (
        resource.data.author.id == request.auth.uid || 
        // Allow updating poll votes or counters if logic permits, otherwise restrict to author:
        request.resource.data.diff(resource.data).affectedKeys().hasOnly(['likeCount', 'repostCount', 'poll', 'commentCount'])
      );
      allow delete: if isSignedIn() && resource.data.author.id == request.auth.uid;
    }

    // Comments
    match /usercomments/{commentId} {
      allow read: if true;
      allow create: if isSignedIn();
      allow update: if isSignedIn() && resource.data.author.id == request.auth.uid;
      allow delete: if isSignedIn() && resource.data.author.id == request.auth.uid;
    }

    // Config/System
    match /config/{docId} {
      allow read: if true;
      allow write: if false; // Admin only
    }
  }
}
```

